{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "bookCode": "RV10",
  "bookSlug": "rig-veda-book-10",
  "n": 156,
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "n": 1,
      "refId": "RV10-156:1",
      "text": "translated by"
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "refId": "RV10-156:2",
      "text": "1. LET songs of ours speed Agni forth like a fleet courser in the race,",
      "original": "अग्निं हिन्वन्तु नो धियः सप्तिमाशुमिवाजिषु ।",
      "translit": "agniṃ hinvantu no dhiyaḥ saptimāśumivājiṣu |"
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "refId": "RV10-156:3",
      "text": "And we will win each prize through him.",
      "original": "तेन जेष्म धनंधनम्",
      "translit": "tena jeṣma dhanaṃdhanam"
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "refId": "RV10-156:4",
      "text": "2. Agni the dart whereby we gain kine for ourselves with help from thee,-",
      "original": "यया गा आकरामहे सेनयाग्ने तवोत्या ।",
      "translit": "yayā gā ākarāmahe senayāgne tavotyā |"
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "refId": "RV10-156:5",
      "text": "That send us for the gain of wealth.",
      "original": "तां नो हिन्व मघत्तये",
      "translit": "tāṃ no hinva maghattaye"
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "refId": "RV10-156:6",
      "text": "3. O Agni, bring us wealth secure, vast wealth in horses and in kine:",
      "original": "आग्ने स्थूरं रयिं भर पृथुं गोमन्तमश्विनम् ।",
      "translit": "āgne sthūraṃ rayiṃ bhara pṛthuṃ gomantamaśvinam |"
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "refId": "RV10-156:7",
      "text": "Oil thou the socket, turn the wheel.",
      "original": "अङ्धि खं वर्तया पणिम्",
      "translit": "aṅdhi khaṃ vartayā paṇim"
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "refId": "RV10-156:8",
      "text": "4. O Agni, thou hast made the Sun, Eternal Star, to mount the sky,",
      "original": "अग्ने नक्षत्रमजरमा सूर्यं रोहयो दिवि ।",
      "translit": "agne nakṣatramajaramā sūryaṃ rohayo divi |"
    },
    {
      "n": 9,
      "refId": "RV10-156:9",
      "text": "Bestowing light on living men.",
      "original": "दधज्ज्योतिर्जनेभ्यः",
      "translit": "dadhajjyotirjanebhyaḥ"
    },
    {
      "n": 10,
      "refId": "RV10-156:10",
      "text": "5. Thou, Agni, art the people's light, best, dearest, seated in thy shrine:",
      "original": "अग्ने केतुर्विशामसि प्रेष्ठः श्रेष्ठ उपस्थसत् ।",
      "translit": "agne keturviśāmasi preṣṭhaḥ śreṣṭha upasthasat |"
    },
    {
      "n": 11,
      "refId": "RV10-156:11",
      "text": "Watch for the singer, give him life.",
      "original": "बोधा स्तोत्रे वयो दधत्",
      "translit": "bodhā stotre vayo dadhat"
    }
  ]
}
